Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.00,Machico,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Opening Talk ===
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,k:0
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,accelerated
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:05.82,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.82,0:00:08.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'm Ruriko Noguchi, the voice of Ichika Hoshino from Leo/need.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:10.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,And kon-wonderhoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.20,0:00:14.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'm Machico,\Nthe voice of Nene- Nene Kusanagi from Wonderlands x Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:16.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And you messed up right at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:18.26,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'm the voice of Nene-Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:18.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I mean, Nene Kusanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:20.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:28.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Sekaraji is a radio program brought to you by the cast of the smartphone game "Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat. Hatsune Miku."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:28.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:31.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Machico-san and I will be your hosts for this episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:36.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's been about a year since the two of us were together, right?\NSince last June?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:37.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It has been about a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:38.22,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Has it really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:39.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Was it that long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:42.60,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It feels like it was just the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:43.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,A whole year has passed before we knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:44.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It really has.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:50.68,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Last time, I remember we tried to use dialects,\Nbut I couldn't do it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:51.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's difficult, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:56.94,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It was hard\Nbecause we were both trying to speak in different dialects,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:00:59.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,but I have fun memories of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:00.56,Machico,host,0,0,0,,And also, look at where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:05.88,Machico,host,0,0,0,,In this timeline, Leo/need's fan meeting was last weekend,\Nand WxS's is this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.88,0:01:07.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's the timeline we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:12.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,In reality, for us, both of them are still...\Nwell, they haven't happened yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:13.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'm really looking forward to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:13.92,Machico,host,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.39,Machico,host,0,0,0,,All the cast members from the units
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:20.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,that have already finished their fan meetings are saying how much fun they had.
Comment: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:20.88,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:20.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:25.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Even the staff are like,\N"It's fine to call it a fan meet!" so I'm getting really excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:27.48,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:29.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's the first time we've called it a "fan meet," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:31.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:31.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder what we'll be doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:43.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Those who attended previous unit fan meets might have an idea,\Nbut I think each unit will bring its own unique flavor to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:44.76,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:45.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:48.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Please look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.48,0:01:52.92,Machico,host,0,0,0,,With that said, let's get started with Sekaraji!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.76,0:02:09.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,This program is brought to you by Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat.\NHATSUNE MIKU.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.60,0:02:15.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Once again, I'm Ruriko Noguchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:16.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,And I'm Machico.
Comment: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:19.80,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Contact Notebook ===
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:19.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,We have another question in the contact notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:24.57,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,We have a question from Tomori-chan and Tanabe-shi,\Nwho were on the last episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:25.07,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:29.08,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"What is the one thing you absolutely have to eat at a summer festival?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:30.10,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:31.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's a summer question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:34.48,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,By the way, Tomori-chan said yakisoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:35.92,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,And Tanabe-shi said buttered potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.81,0:02:36.31,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:38.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So they went for the heavy food?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:39.84,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're both pretty filling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.79,0:02:40.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.80,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Well, I really love yakisoba too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.80,0:02:44.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yakisoba is great, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:46.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Buttered potatoes are good too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.48,0:02:49.83,Machico,host,0,0,0,,But don't you think buttered potatoes are kind of hard to eat outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:50.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:51.56,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They're a bit big.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.56,0:02:52.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And they get crumbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:52.77,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:55.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You really have to dig into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:56.37,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They're so delicious, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:58.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, what would I pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:01.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,If we're talking sweets, I'd have to go with shaved ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:02.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:03.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,What flavor do you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:04.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Strawberry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:08.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I get strawberry and add as much condensed milk as they'll let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:10.48,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'm a huge fan of condensed milk too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:13.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I honestly feel like shaved ice isn't complete without condensed milk.
Comment: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:14.68,Machico,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:14.68,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm on the condensed milk side too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:16.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,You absolutely need condensed milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:17.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.83,Machico,host,0,0,0,,But you know how at those popular stalls,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:21.84,Machico,host,0,0,0,,the condensed milk they have out for the shaved ice is always almost gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:22.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I know exactly what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:25.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'm always thinking, "Please, just find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:26.48,Machico,host,0,0,0,,to keep it constantly refilled!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:27.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:29.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Shaved ice is just so popular, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:29.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:30.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Hmm, what else for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:31.27,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:37.03,Machico,host,0,0,0,,things like frankfurters or beef tongue skewers. when I came to Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:43.59,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I thought it was so rare to see all those meat skewers lined up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:35.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Beef tongue skewers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.59,0:03:44.09,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.30,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Beef tongue skewers...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:46.80,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They're so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:52.56,Machico,host,0,0,0,,The prices are definitely "festival prices," but that's all part of the summer festival experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.49,0:03:48.99,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:54.47,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Eating them there makes them taste even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:55.32,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Exactly, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:56.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Man, that sounds so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:58.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Now I'm getting hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.60,0:04:01.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Have you been going to festivals at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:02.28,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Have you gone recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:07.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I haven't been to any fireworks displays,\Nbut I have been to those other ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:05.81,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:10.68,Machico,host,0,0,0,,The ones where you pray for success in business...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:12.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, I know the ones.
Comment: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:12.80,Machico,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:12.80,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:14.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You mean for business prosperity, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:23.08,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I've been going with friends for that, and for the past few years,\Nwe've started buying those decorative rakes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:22.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:26.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,And we definitely hit up the food stalls too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:27.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Wow, that sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:28.60,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Does that mean you don't go very often?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:29.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I haven't gone at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:30.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I haven't been in about ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:33.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,There are just too many people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:34.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:46.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Summers now are so different from when we were students.\NIt's so hot, and there are just so many people everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:46.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,There really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:47.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:52.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Even back home in the countryside, festivals were a big deal, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:54.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, the crowds here are on a whole different level.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:55.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:58.99,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I mean, I want to see the fireworks, but honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:04:58.39,Machico,host,0,0,0,,On YouTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:04:59.49,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Via livestream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:00.79,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Even a livestream is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.79,0:05:01.41,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:01.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:02.92,Machico,host,0,0,0,,In a nice cool room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:04.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We'll watch from an air-conditioned room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:05.45,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:06.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:11.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well,\Nwe'll leave a comment in the contact notebook later too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:12.13,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Comment: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:13.88,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Listener Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:13.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,All right, let's look at the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:15.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:18.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Okay, this one is from Radio name: Akarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:19.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:20.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:22.84,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Hello to everyone at Sekaraji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:24.68,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,My name is Akarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:27.08,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'm a newcomer who just started playing ProSeka in July.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:31.70,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I've been steadily working through the events lately,\Nbut with the voice acting,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:36.88,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,everyone's performance is so good and the content is so intense\Nthat I practically need stomach medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:44.38,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Are there any scenes in the ProSeka stories or character interactions\Nthat you find particularly precious while performing or watching them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:45.84,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if you read this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:46.56,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,ProSeka is the best!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:48.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:49.75,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:54.68,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Speaking of us, in terms of characters,\NIchika Hoshino and Nene Kusanagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:56.74,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while now, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:59.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, since the two of them started interacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:01.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Nene Kusanagi has definitely gotten more used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:01.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Like, "I'm going to practice singing..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:05.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:06.08,Machico,host,0,0,0,,"...want to join me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:06.71,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:08.76,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, like she's the one inviting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:12.38,Machico,host,0,0,0,,And Ichika Hoshino looks so happy and is like, "I'd love to!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.38,0:06:14.22,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I really love those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:21.08,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Also, in the Connect Live this past May,\NIchika Hoshino and Nene Kusanagi finally sang together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:23.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I was so happy to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:25.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Hearing their confession...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:26.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It was truly beautiful.
Comment: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:28.32,Machico,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:28.32,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They must have practiced so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:29.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:33.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're practicing even in the parts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:34.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,that aren't shown in the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:35.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Well, it couldn't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:37.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They did go on a study abroad trip to space, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:38.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:41.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,There were so many mysterious stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It was really cute to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:48.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,But you know, ProSeka is about to reach its 5th anniversary,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:50.14,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I think the next one is the 6th.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:50.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It'll be the 6th anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:51.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Time flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I just realized this is the first time we've done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:54.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:55.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:57.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It really did take a while for just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:07:01.57,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Seeing the precious bond between those two take shape like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:02.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It really did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:06.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,As fans, we were just so happy to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:07.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's pure bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:08.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.43,0:07:09.06,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:10.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Let's move on to the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:11.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:14.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,This is from Radio name: Katsuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.30,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you for writing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:18.13,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Noguchi-san, Machico-san, kon-Wonderhoi!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:18.63,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Kon-Wonderhoi!
Comment: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:19.18,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:19.18,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-wonderhoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:20.01,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:24.97,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Lately, I've been into making my own original hiyashi chuka."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:25.31,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:25.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:29.04,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I buy fresh noodles at the supermarket and make the sauce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:29.60,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:30.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:34.84,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Well, it's just adding seasonings to ponzu, but it's delicious. Do you two eat hiyashi chuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:36.77,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.77,0:07:37.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:38.76,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Do you have any favorite noodle dishes?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:39.23,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:41.54,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they sent in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:42.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:44.56,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's definitely the season for slurping noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:47.10,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You really start craving cold noodles, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.10,0:07:48.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They're so easy to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:51.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Man, hiyashi chuka, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:53.09,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Have you started yet this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:53.59,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:53.99,Machico,host,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:57.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Actually, I might not have started for several years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:58.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:00.77,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Is it even possible to finish summer without starting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:01.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:02.55,Machico,host,0,0,0,,You must really like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.16,0:08:04.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You must really like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:05.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I always start every year.
Comment: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:07.73,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:07.73,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I start summer a little early.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:08.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Early, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:12.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Even before it gets hot, I'm already thinking,\N"It's almost cold ramen season."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:14.06,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Well, it is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.06,0:08:16.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Cold ramen is so easy to eat in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:23.14,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And you know, compared to regular ramen—I still eat\Nthat too—but I feel less guilty about the calories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.14,0:08:24.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Though they're probably not that different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:25.87,Machico,host,0,0,0,,No, I totally get what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.87,0:08:26.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:28.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Because it just slides right down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:28.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, since it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:30.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It definitely feels like there's less guilt involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:41.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Lately, what I've been into making isn't cold ramen,\Nbut somen noodles, where the dipping sauce...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:37.31,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:40.09,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:51.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I mix soy milk and silken tofu together until it's a thick,\Ncreamy soup, then I add white dashi or some powdered...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.99,0:08:46.49,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.23,0:08:48.73,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:55.45,Machico,host,0,0,0,,...chicken stock,\Nand then I like to top it with things like meat miso,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:59.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,green onions, and chili oil before mixing it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:00.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That sounds way too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's incredibly tasty and so easy to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:02.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I want to try that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:03.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's really simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:04.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:05.32,Machico,host,0,0,0,,You can make it in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's great,\Nit sounds like something you could eat even in the summer heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:08.89,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's very easy to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.89,0:09:09.39,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:15.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, and when you make the dipping sauce out of tofu,\Nyou feel like you're actually getting some nutrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:16.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's pure protein!
Comment: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:17.32,Machico,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:17.32,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's exactly what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.96,0:09:19.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That sounds so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:19.94,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I highly recommend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:24.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,If you mix soy milk and tofu, it makes a really simple soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:24.95,Machico,host,0,0,0,,And it's cold, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:25.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:26.05,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's easy to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.11,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Plus, you don't have to wait for it to cool down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:30.61,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:31.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:32.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So you can eat it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:33.83,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I've been making it a lot lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.83,0:09:34.33,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:39.48,Machico,host,0,0,0,,When it comes to noodles, oh, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:38.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:40.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I really love udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:41.68,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Have you started on the udon yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:42.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I've definitely started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Actually, I had udon for dinner last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:45.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Both hot and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:47.88,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're both great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:48.56,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Speaking of summer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:50.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You can eat it either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:52.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's just so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:58.41,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Whenever I'm going abroad,\NI always make sure to eat udon at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:09:58.91,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:03.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I want to get some Japanese dashi in my system before I leave the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:00.99,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Comment: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:05.68,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:05.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really is the taste of Japan, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:08.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, and it's so easy to eat, even first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:11.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well, in my hometown of Fukuoka, udon is actually quite famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:14.41,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Oh, Fukuoka udon is a bit on the softer side, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:15.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Right, right, it's soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:19.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I get these intense cravings for Fukuoka udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:23.44,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Oh, do you even order it from Fukuoka when you're eating it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:24.10,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I do, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:25.35,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Quite often, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:26.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:27.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like the burdock tempura udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:28.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Ah, there it is, the burdock tempura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:29.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Those huge...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:31.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,The ones with about four huge, long pieces in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:33.90,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Those are just so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:35.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I want to eat them all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:35.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Man, that sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:37.68,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I want some too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:38.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:39.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:44.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's just that time during our recording session\Nwhere we start getting hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:45.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:47.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's a great way to work up an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:48.86,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.86,0:10:49.73,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:54.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Well, that's all for the listener mail for now. Thank you all so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:55.48,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:56.25,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Just like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:11:00.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,we're waiting for any questions or themes you'd like to ask the ProSeka cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:01.05,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yes, we are.
Comment: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:04.66,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song ===
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:04.66,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,And now, it's time to play a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:09.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,This track was written for us by ukalo6.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:14.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's the featured song for the Leo/need event "Echo my melody".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:16.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Please have a listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:17.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,"Tenbin," by Saki Tenma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:29.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Sekaraji.
Comment: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:36.76,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Theme Mail ===
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:36.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,For this episode,\Nwe asked for mail on this theme:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:39.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,"How I spend my time at home."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:43.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:46.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Summer is still going strong, and it's very hot out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:47.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:52.50,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's important to avoid going out unnecessarily and stay cool at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:57.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So, we asked you how you've been spending your time at home on these hot days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:14:00.71,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Let's get right into the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:01.21,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Here's the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:04.83,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,It's from Radio name: Schrodinger's Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:05.60,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:07.51,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Hello, Noguchi-san and Machico-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:08.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:11.80,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The way I spend my time at home is by reading books."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:12.88,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Oh, that's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:25.16,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I started reading after joining the library committee at school last year, and I've encountered so many interesting works. Even now, during summer vacation, I read whenever I have time."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:31.24,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Lately, I've been reading 'Kokoro' by Natsume Soseki, which my teacher recommended in class."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:31.63,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Oh wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:40.46,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The content is quite difficult, and I have to re-read the same parts over and over to understand them, so my progress is at a snail's pace."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:51.84,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I understand the words, but not the meaning. Just like Nene-chan, who works hard at singing and acting with her friends, I'll keep pushing through 'Kokoro'."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:52.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:53.15,Machico,host,0,0,0,,So impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:54.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:57.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,With Soseki, the wording is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:15:01.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It feels old, since there are so many archaic words.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:02.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You end up not knowing what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:04.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:08.60,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I read something by Akutagawa Ryunosuke once and had no idea what was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:09.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I didn't get it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:11.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I couldn't even understand the vocabulary.
Comment: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:15.54,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:15.54,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, are you good at reading books?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:23.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I have periods where I'm really into it and want to read,\Nbut I end up with a huge pile of unread books.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:27.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,If I'm not in the right mood, I don't want to read at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I've actually finished very few books in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:30.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:34.28,Machico,host,0,0,0,,There just aren't many moments where I feel like reading a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.28,0:15:35.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:35.99,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:37.57,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Is it the printed word?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.57,0:15:38.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,The printed word.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:40.33,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'm just not very good with text.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:46.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I've always felt that way,\Nso I really respect people who can read books.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:47.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's impressive. So, Radio name: Schrodinger's Cat...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.04,0:15:48.54,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,...wrote in to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:49.80,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I joined the library committee."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's the same as Nene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:51.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Just like Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.96,0:15:54.08,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I was on the library committee too, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:54.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.79,0:15:55.29,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:56.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You were?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:15:58.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,But I didn't really read the books...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:00.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe things like "Takoyakiman"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:02.53,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Those are easy to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.53,0:16:03.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:04.28,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Or "Kaiketsu Zorori."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:05.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,The ones with pictures are fun, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:06.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,In the end, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:09.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Like the "Komatta-san" and "Wakatta-san" cooking series.
Comment: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:09.64,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:09.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.64,0:16:11.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Children's books really are interesting, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.92,0:16:13.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Those are the ones that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:13.79,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Really leave an impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:14.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:19.56,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's always been hard for me to read books\Nthat don't have many illustrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:22.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well, they do require a lot of concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:25.33,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's why I'm honestly surprised I'm doing this kind of work now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.33,0:16:25.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:28.92,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can do it properly when it's for a project or for work, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:32.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Maybe it's different when you're reading with the intent to perform?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:37.08,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It definitely feels different when it's just for a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:34.57,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:39.22,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:41.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well, I hope they keep working through their reading list.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:42.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Are there any books you've found interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:47.85,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I used to like novels, but lately I've been getting into essays.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.85,0:16:54.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I have a few favorite essayists,\Nso I've been reading their work one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.48,0:16:56.41,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Nene would be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:57.13,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:17:00.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Everyone has their own different hobbies, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:01.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:03.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Reading all of Natsume Soseki...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:03.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Good luck with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:04.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:09.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host_meta,0,0,0,,Moving on,\Nthis next one is from Radio name: Ohashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:10.87,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you for writing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.87,0:17:11.60,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:13.32,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Noguchi-san, Machico-san, kon-wonderhoi!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:14.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Kon-wonderhoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:17.64,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The hot days are continuing, but how are you both doing?"
Comment: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:22.14,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:22.14,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'm currently in the middle of summer vacation, so I spend almost every day at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.14,0:17:26.73,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,However, even though I'm at home,\NI'm super busy preparing for the upcoming school festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.73,0:17:27.28,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:29.88,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'm in the cast for a play at the festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.88,0:17:34.55,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,and I've been given the important role of the protagonist's long-lost sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:38.70,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,so I'm practicing while using the WxS members' acting as a reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.70,0:17:41.40,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Also,\NI'll be playing the drums in a band for the first time in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:42.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:45.61,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,At my school,\Nthird-year students focus on entrance exams, so this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.61,0:17:48.92,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,as a second-year, is the last year I can participate in the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.81,0:17:49.48,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:54.08,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,Since it's my first and last chance to be in a band as a high schooler,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:57.48,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I convinced the other members to perform 'STORY'."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.48,0:17:58.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:00.85,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"The acting is difficult, but I'm doing my best to practice."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:01.35,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:04.79,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's literally just like Leo/need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:09.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,And they're doing a play too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's amazing, just like WxS!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:10.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:11.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:13.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That listener mail was absolutely perfect for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.53,0:18:15.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:16.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Isn't that hard, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:18.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I could never play the drums.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.61,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Wow, and the drums of all things?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:20.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,The drums?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.27,0:18:21.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.38,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's the same as Honami.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.38,0:18:24.75,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Just like Hona-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:25.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:27.92,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's going to be such a great summer memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:32.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it'll be a wonderful memory once they've pulled it off.
Comment: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:33.92,Machico,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:33.92,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Man, I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:35.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's real youth right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:35.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And doing all that at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:38.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,True, they must be super busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:42.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They definitely are. It's more than just a summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:44.08,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Doing all that during a gap year... wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:45.84,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:47.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'm envious. Make sure to take lots of photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:49.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Take videos too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:50.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You definitely need to save some videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:52.60,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:57.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Back when I was a student, we all had flip phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:58.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:18:59.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We had SD cards and stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:03.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,but the way you'd even record things was totally different from smartphones now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:07.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Because of that, I really don't have any old photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:08.60,Machico,host,0,0,0,,We really don't, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:12.46,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I wish I'd developed more of them. Back then, I had my phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:13.07,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,so I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.07,0:19:17.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,"I can just look back at these whenever," but then the era changed and flip phones disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:18.68,Machico,host,0,0,0,,You don't really think about the times changing like that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:23.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's sad when you realize you don't have the device to look back on those memories anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.40,0:19:24.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.40,0:19:30.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure people use SD cards and the cloud now,\Nbut you never know when those might,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.12,0:19:31.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,you know, just crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:32.84,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:35.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,So for my sake, please back everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:38.39,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Seriously, I have almost no photos from my teens
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:38.99,Machico,host,0,0,0,,on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:39.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Comment: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:41.20,Machico,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:41.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I can't even remember what we were doing, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:43.64,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I just remember that we were having a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:48.28,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I wonder what I even lived for back in middle and high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.28,0:19:52.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like, on the way home,\Na friend would get hyped and start singing some nonsense song,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:54.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,and I'd record it and watch it over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.71,0:19:55.21,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:57.34,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Was it actually fun, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Was I even doing anything interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:19:59.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:01.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Is it just nostalgia filter at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:04.23,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's that youth filter where even a rolling pebble is hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.23,0:20:05.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:06.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,But those are the best moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.52,0:20:07.44,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, they really are fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.52,0:20:09.80,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Man, I miss being young.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:10.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:11.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Good luck with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:13.67,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It might be tough, but hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:14.17,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You can definitely do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:15.76,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.76,0:20:16.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:18.88,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,All right, let's move on to the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:19.05,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:21.88,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,This is from Radio name: Takku TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:22.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.88,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Noguchi-san, Machico-san, kon-Wonderhoi!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.61,0:20:26.11,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-Wonderhoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:27.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Kon-Wonderhoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.24,0:20:28.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-Wonderhoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:29.80,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I always enjoy listening to the radio."
Comment: 0,0:20:30.32,0:20:33.96,Machico,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.32,0:20:33.96,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"How do I spend my time at home? I spend it drawing."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:37.75,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"It all started when an online friend gave me a ridiculous challenge."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:38.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:41.04,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Once I actually tried drawing, I really got into it."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:44.32,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Even now, I enjoy drawing copies of ProSeka characters."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.32,0:20:49.16,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"My goal for the future is to have one of my outfit designs used in ProSeka."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:49.84,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I'll do my best!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:51.04,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:52.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.05,0:20:52.55,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:54.65,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.65,0:20:55.39,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.39,0:20:56.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Not just drawing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:20:59.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,but designing clothes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:58.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They really got hooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:06.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I've said this many times on Sekaraji,\Nbut I have so much respect for people who can draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:07.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Are you not very good at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.48,0:21:10.60,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Well, I'm in this awkward middle ground where I'm not good,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:12.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,but I'm not laughably bad either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:12.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,But wait, the outfits...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.05,0:21:14.73,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:15.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:17.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's not like you can't draw at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:18.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,No, it's not that I can't draw at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.24,0:21:19.95,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,But don't you think there are way too many people in the voice acting industry
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:20.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,who are good at drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:22.80,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That is so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.80,0:21:26.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Their skill level is just... it makes you go, "What even is this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:25.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's mind-boggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.40,0:21:27.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.77,0:21:28.27,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Comment: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:28.57,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:28.57,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Wait, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.40,0:21:33.82,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I really don't have anything I could draw while looking at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:34.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.72,0:21:38.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,so I can't really move beyond just doing it as a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:39.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, and it's not like I have any original ideas either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.92,0:21:42.91,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.91,0:21:43.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:46.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Tracing is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:53.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well, tracing is how it starts.\NYou imitate things first, and then you gradually find your own style.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:55.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:58.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,And eventually, you'll be doing designs too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:21:58.92,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm looking forward to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.92,0:22:01.11,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I hope your design gets selected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:02.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:06.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I want to see the characters singing and dancing in those clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.16,0:22:12.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I always get so excited\Nwhen they announce the winning costume designs on the broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.24,0:22:15.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Not just the winners,\Nbut even the honorable mentions are so high-level.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.32,0:22:15.97,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.97,0:22:16.61,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,How do they do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.61,0:22:17.25,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Why are they so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:20.32,Machico,host,0,0,0,,What is going on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:23.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't think I could ever do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.68,0:22:26.10,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I like combining existing things, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:33.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm very good at creating something from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.73,0:22:28.43,Machico,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.43,0:22:29.13,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.52,0:22:31.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:34.82,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's so cool.
Comment: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:36.67,Machico,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:36.67,Machico,host,0,0,0,,People who can do design or draw...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.67,0:22:37.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.28,0:22:46.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,There are so many designs and color palettes\Nthat are heavily influenced by movies or things from overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.12,0:22:50.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,You should watch all kinds of works to boost your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.27,0:22:48.77,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.76,0:22:51.42,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Boost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.42,0:22:54.47,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I bet you'll improve even more over this summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:22:55.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:56.26,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Keep drawing, keep drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:57.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.07,0:22:57.57,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.32,0:22:59.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Okay, next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.04,0:22:59.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.88,0:23:02.96,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Radio name: C-chan Daisuki JK.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.96,0:23:04.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.12,0:23:04.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.96,0:23:07.28,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Noguchi-san, Machico-san, kon-Wonderhoi!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:07.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Kon-Wonderhoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.89,0:23:08.56,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Kon-Wonderhoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:10.68,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Please excuse me for writing in for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:10.93,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.68,0:23:15.72,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,How I spend my time at home is,\Nquite simply, composing music and singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.69,0:23:16.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.40,0:23:22.28,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I've been using the laptop provided by my school to make songs on a music creation site,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.83,0:23:19.33,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.28,0:23:24.12,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,but it's really difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.11,0:23:24.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.72,0:23:28.00,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I've also loved singing\Nsince I was little and have been doing it ever since,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.00,0:23:33.70,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,but lately I feel like I'm not very good\Nbecause I'm not mindful of my abdominal breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.70,0:23:39.56,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'll practice for years and years to become a great singer like Ichika-chan and Nene-chan!"
Comment: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:42.37,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:42.37,Ruriko Noguchi,listener_mail,0,0,0,,I'll always love ProSeka and all the songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.37,0:23:43.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Aww, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.24,0:23:44.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's so sweet. But wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.40,0:23:46.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Using a computer provided by the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.80,0:23:47.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what caught my eye first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:48.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.40,0:23:50.27,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They actually give out computers now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.27,0:23:50.77,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Do they really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.88,0:23:55.80,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I've heard of tablets, but do they really hand out full computers?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:23:57.02,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's a first for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.02,0:23:59.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Wow, I can't keep up with the times.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.04,0:24:00.84,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Since she's a JK, she's a high schooler, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.84,0:24:01.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:04.80,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Honestly, doing Sekaraji lets us hear about what's... how do I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.80,0:24:08.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It lets us hear about what's trendy and what schools are like these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.80,0:24:11.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder if they even have textbooks anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:12.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe it's all on tablets now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:13.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.52,0:24:14.56,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's probably headed that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.64,0:24:16.50,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I totally get it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.50,0:24:18.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Back in the day, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.88,0:24:23.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I lost a textbook for one of my subjects and had to keep borrowing one from another class.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.60,0:24:27.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,If tablets can prevent that, they're definitely better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.56,0:24:28.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.16,0:24:31.28,Machico,host,0,0,0,,There were times when they'd insist we take everything home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.28,0:24:32.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It was so heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.44,0:24:36.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I used to just leave mine at school,\Neven if they threatened to confiscate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.04,0:24:37.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We used to call that "okiben."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.28,0:24:38.50,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, we called it "okiben" too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.50,0:24:40.92,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I guess you don't have to worry about that with a tablet.
Comment: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:42.56,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:42.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,No, I don't think there's anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.56,0:24:43.29,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.29,0:24:44.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's really impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.12,0:24:46.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Writing songs and practicing singing...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.20,0:24:47.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Wow, that sounds so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.64,0:24:52.90,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,But you know,\Nwhen it comes to practicing singing and leveling up from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.90,0:24:55.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I think the basics are important, like abdominal breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.72,0:24:59.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,But rather than focusing on what you have to be careful about,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.92,0:25:06.10,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I think it might be better to just have fun for now and figure out what state makes you feel best
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.10,0:25:07.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,while singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.00,0:25:14.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,If you treat things like abdominal breathing as secondary,\Nyou might be able to sing more freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.12,0:25:15.08,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.08,0:25:16.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I just have a feeling about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.72,0:25:18.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That is wonderful advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.32,0:25:24.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,If you get too stiff and formal, it might narrow your possibilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.12,0:25:27.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,so I feel like it's okay to just do it freely for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.04,0:25:30.82,Machico,host,0,0,0,,A time might come eventually\Nwhere you have to think about all those details.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.82,0:25:35.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,You could even think of it as,\N"This is the only time I can sing however I want," and just go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.64,0:25:39.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,If you're taking vocal lessons and they have some kind of exam for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.24,0:25:41.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,then sure, it's better to master those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.44,0:25:42.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Still, they're so admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.72,0:25:44.48,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Being so conscious of things like abdominal breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.36,0:25:47.22,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They must really love music.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.22,0:25:49.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Writing their own songs and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.16,0:25:50.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.52,0:25:51.72,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And they're a high schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.72,0:25:53.60,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Man, what on earth was I doing back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.40,0:25:56.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I didn't create anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:25:57.32,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.32,0:25:59.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I only created unnecessary trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.08,0:26:00.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's not true!
Comment: 0,0:26:00.04,0:26:01.16,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.04,0:26:01.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I'd draw weird manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.68,0:26:03.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I just did fun things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.56,0:26:06.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's pretty much all I did back then too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.56,0:26:09.80,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Students who actually produce creative work are so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.80,0:26:12.16,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's amazing. For me, it was just part-time jobs all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.16,0:26:15.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I was always going to see plays and things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.36,0:26:17.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, so you were already interested in acting back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.30,0:26:17.80,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.80,0:26:19.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I loved watching stage performances.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.20,0:26:22.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'd watch comedy shows too. I was always just watching something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.72,0:26:27.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Comedians are different from stage actors, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.40,0:26:30.00,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They really have a unique way of acting and performing, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.00,0:26:30.92,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Oh, I totally get what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.92,0:26:36.82,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's why I can see why comedians are so good at things like dramas or voice acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.82,0:26:37.32,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.32,0:26:39.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's always so impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.64,0:26:41.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They have such rich imaginations.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.23,0:26:41.94,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.94,0:26:43.65,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Their skits are always so funny too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.65,0:26:44.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Their acting skills are no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.36,0:26:46.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Their sense of timing is so unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.41,0:26:47.40,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I really loved that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.40,0:26:50.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's definitely good input for your own work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.48,0:26:51.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.20,0:26:52.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Let's keep getting lots of input.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.55,0:26:53.22,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.22,0:26:56.49,Machico,host,0,0,0,,And then you can use it in your composing and singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.49,0:26:57.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,That's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.04,0:26:58.44,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.27,0:26:58.77,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Comment: 0,0:26:58.44,0:27:00.36,Machico,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.44,0:27:00.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,The future is bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.36,0:27:02.19,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's great to have young people like that supporting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.19,0:27:02.69,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.44,0:27:04.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.88,0:27:07.42,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,All right, I'll read one last piece of mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.42,0:27:09.40,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,This one is from Radio name: Suiha.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.40,0:27:10.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.12,0:27:11.60,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"Noguchi-san, Machico-san, kon-wonderhoi!"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.60,0:27:12.44,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.44,0:27:15.24,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"My way of spending time at home is playing ProSeka."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.23,0:27:15.75,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.75,0:27:16.26,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.26,0:27:19.94,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I love rhythm games, but lately I've been catching up on the stories."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.94,0:27:23.44,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"I've read the Leo/need and WxS stories,"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.44,0:27:28.54,Machico,listener_mail,0,0,0,,"and they're all so memorable that I can't fit them all in my favorites list."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:28.85,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.54,0:27:30.70,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,That's what they wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.70,0:27:31.56,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.56,0:27:34.76,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,So they're reading the stories while playing the rhythm game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.76,0:27:42.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,ProSeka really does put so much effort into writing these stories,\Ndon't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.96,0:27:43.84,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.84,0:27:45.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It makes them so worth reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.56,0:27:52.76,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Every unit has such a different, rich story unfolding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.28,0:27:55.48,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, the stories are really incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.60,0:27:58.76,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I hope you keep enjoying them to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.76,0:28:00.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And you can go back and watch the past ones, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.41,0:28:01.28,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.28,0:28:02.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It's such a nice feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.20,0:28:04.60,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Whether you just started or you've been playing for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:05.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Comment: 0,0:28:05.31,0:28:05.81,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.31,0:28:05.81,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.44,0:28:07.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Aw, that makes me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.20,0:28:09.36,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It makes all our recording sessions feel worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.36,0:28:10.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.36,0:28:12.96,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's just so nice to know that someone is actually reading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.60,0:28:14.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really warms your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.32,0:28:17.16,Machico,host,0,0,0,,After we put so much effort into the acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.16,0:28:21.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Because in ProSeka,\Nwe have recording sessions for songs and dialogue...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.84,0:28:23.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,They happen pretty regularly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.88,0:28:24.88,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Oh, they're incredibly regular.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.08,0:28:30.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Right, so we're always like, "Oh, I know this feeling."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.01,0:28:29.51,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.92,0:28:32.92,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Like, "Oh, a new story is coming out already."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.92,0:28:35.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They keep getting updated so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.12,0:28:40.40,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And the word count each time is just... wow, it's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.68,0:28:38.64,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I totally get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.40,0:28:43.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,With all the different event stories and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.20,0:28:44.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We can really feel
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.48,0:28:50.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,that the team puts just as much effort into the stories as they do the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.93,0:28:48.43,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:51.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,We definitely feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.20,0:28:53.08,Machico,host,0,0,0,,We'll keep doing our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.08,0:28:54.08,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We'll keep giving it our all in our performances.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.08,0:28:56.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,We'll keep singing and acting with everything we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.36,0:28:57.28,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Please look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.28,0:28:58.58,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.58,0:29:01.62,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,And with that, that's all the mail for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.62,0:29:04.24,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you for all the listener mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.76,0:29:08.66,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,We presented these under the theme of "How I Spend My Time at Home."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.66,0:29:10.04,Machico,host_meta,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.91,0:29:10.41,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes.
Comment: 0,0:29:39.80,0:29:41.46,Machico,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Ending ===
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.80,0:29:41.46,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's all for this episode of Sekaraji.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.46,0:29:42.60,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's time for the ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.60,0:29:46.14,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yes. We're always looking for your submissions for the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.14,0:29:47.84,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,The address is sekairadio@pjsekai.jp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.00,0:29:53.46,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Please check the official ProSeka X account for more details.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.46,0:29:55.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Please send in your mail as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.88,0:29:58.26,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And don't forget to include your radio name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.26,0:29:58.76,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.76,0:30:02.50,Machico,host,0,0,0,,The next episode will also be a unit shuffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.50,0:30:03.50,Machico,host,0,0,0,,With that in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.50,0:30:07.50,Machico,host,0,0,0,,let's leave a comment in the contact notebook for the next cast members.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.50,0:30:14.00,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Our question is: "What's something fun you did this summer, or something you're looking forward to?"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.00,0:30:15.44,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.44,0:30:16.76,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,We'll get to hear what everyone's up to lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.76,0:30:17.72,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.72,0:30:18.95,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It can be anything, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.95,0:30:19.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.52,0:30:23.44,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'd love for them to answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.32,0:30:25.36,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Well, it's time to wrap things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.36,0:30:25.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Is it over already?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.76,0:30:28.32,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Sekaraji always goes by so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:32.24,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I really look forward to reading the listener mail every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.24,0:30:35.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,There's still so many we haven't been able to read yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.04,0:30:39.84,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's such a precious time for us to hear about what's going on with the students.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.84,0:30:43.88,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for teaching us about youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.88,0:30:45.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,We really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.12,0:30:45.78,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.78,0:30:49.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,thanks to the adult fans for always letting us know how you're doing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.12,0:30:52.26,Machico,host,0,0,0,,They're right there with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.26,0:30:55.41,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It's a valuable chance to hear about everyone's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.41,0:30:56.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.12,0:30:57.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,It went by in a flash.
Comment: 0,0:30:57.19,0:30:57.69,Ruriko Noguchi,,0,0,0,,[autosub] Chunk boundary - review translation around this line
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.19,0:30:57.69,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Sigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.36,0:30:59.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,To be a student again...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.04,0:31:01.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I bet they're really looking forward to summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.12,0:31:04.34,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous. I want summer vacation too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.34,0:31:05.88,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I really want one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.88,0:31:09.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,But if I had two months off now, would I just run out of things to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.52,0:31:10.48,Machico,host,0,0,0,,That might actually be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.48,0:31:13.02,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Why did it never feel like enough time when we were students?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.02,0:31:14.22,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Was it because of the homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.22,0:31:14.95,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Homework...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.52,0:31:16.20,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,It was all its fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.20,0:31:19.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Making me suffer on the very last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.04,0:31:20.12,Machico,host,0,0,0,,My last days were always pretty intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.12,0:31:21.12,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,The last day was?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.12,0:31:24.84,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Starting about three days before, I'd start thinking,\N"Wait, maybe I won't be able to go to school..."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.00,0:31:27.04,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Ah, you'd start to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.04,0:31:29.04,Machico,host,0,0,0,,I'd end up drawing about ten days' worth of picture diaries all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.04,0:31:32.52,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,And you have to fill in the weather, so you just put whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.52,0:31:33.84,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Sunny, sunny, rainy, cloudy...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.32,0:31:36.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,I definitely just winged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.48,0:31:37.68,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Me too, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:39.24,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Well, homework is something you can only do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.24,0:31:40.56,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Good luck, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.56,0:31:42.92,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Please enjoy your summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.44,0:31:46.20,Machico,host,0,0,0,,And with that, it's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.20,0:31:48.48,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Your hosts were Ruriko Noguchi and...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.48,0:31:49.52,Machico,host,0,0,0,,Machico.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.60,0:31:55.96,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,This program was brought to you by Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.48,0:31:58.68,Ruriko Noguchi,host,0,0,0,,Hatsune Miku.
